<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs $0.50-1.00 lower  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs $0.50-1.00 lower  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 lower than Wednesday's close. Demand and Supply light.</p>
<p>Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    57.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 1-2    210-220 lbs    54.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-230 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    56.50-57.50</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    55.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows steady to 2.00 lower. Top 46.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-43.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    45.00-46.00</p>
